赶出家门,母亲重病她不得不这么做。一夜绵过后,筹到钱,可是母亲已经离开,看着离去的母亲她的心开始变冷,冉冉升起了复仇的理念,她不在懦弱,那日她人间蒸发。六年后,为了复仇而归,她完全脱变,聪明、美丽、更是夸国企业的女总裁,处事精明,开始策划一切。可是,谁能想到女总裁的背后掌舵者居然是一个五岁的男孩。———以下即将完结文————【谁家王妃1鸡妃狗跳】她龙雪十足的现代小痞子,满嘴谎话连篇,飞来横祸的穿越,让她成了刚出生的弃婴小娃,都说大难不死必有后福,这话果真不假,不仅练得一身好武艺,耳朵还出于常人,能听懂动物的语言。出谷游玩,寻思着,开开妓院,搞搞设计,顺便再拐几个美男后宫,可,谁知的……惹上了不该惹的人,一道圣旨,便将她赐给了当今瑾王。靠,王爷了不起啊?丫的敢娶我,老娘拍死你……费尽心思,折腾到鸡飞狗跳,丫的,还是要嫁,靠,豁出去了,为了将来,她嫁……大婚当天,洞房花烛,你看我碍眼,我看你不爽嘞！啊,神啊,古代真是美男的天堂啊,是个人长得都帅,管你是什么太子王爷,她都一并全收,做好开鸭店的准备,开鸭店啊……咦?做梦都想开鸭店,可是到最后为何把自己给鸭进去了……?推荐文文:【蛇王选妃】她是考古研究生,天生带着一身异能电,异世重生,风云起。昔日帝都第一草包花痴小姐失踪归来,她变成了她,深藏不漏是她的原则,扮猪吃老虎是她的爱好。“穆家小姐终于有人要了……”人群中有人大喊,帝都年轻男子顿时高呼万岁。嫁人?行！就当是给自己找个活靠山。“爱妃听闻你要电死本王…”低沉而邪魅的声音传来,温热的气息喷子她的脖子之上。某女一听,大手一拍:“靠,哪个王八犊子造谣,老娘拍死他！”“爱妃本王…”某女笑面如花揪起他的衣领:“想要当我的男人,就不要藏头畏尾。”某王一愣,随即魅惑一笑,金色的蛇尾缠绕在她的身上:“好,为了你,本王全部露出来。”异世风云,一场万兽之宴,她萌兽强悍,群蛇为伍,一夜扬名天下。她风头出尽,天下万蛇供她差遣,更要命的是,身边的男人还是条蛇王祖宗……【王的大牌特工妃】【完结】她,中国最年轻的天才特工,一朝穿越,却成了相府‘废材’傻小姐,当她转眼变成她,她笑中带刀,你狠我更狠,你恶我更恶！风云起,天下乱,她天生傲骨,逆行九天,这天下不尽是男儿的天下,女人同样可主沉浮,她的占有欲很大,要问到底有多大,天有多大,她的心就有多大……【致命狂妃】她,是杀手王者,生杀予夺,我行我素,大楼引爆,异世重生,面对家族灭门,血腥在一次渲染她的手。他,是大兴的绝色王爷,铁血冷酷,却一眼相中了她。“放眼天下我不会为任何人卖命。”两人对崎,她狂傲至极的话语,简直如同一个君王般让人膜拜。异世纵横,弱肉强食,遇神弑神,遇魔诛魔,问鼎天下,笑傲江湖,万里狂沙征圣狐,天下狼烟,血战杀戮,狂傲如她。乱世之战,烽火倾城,谁能主宰?【极品爽文,女主强大至极,男主强大,配角们也强大,美男多多,结局一对一】———以下即将完结文————【谁家王妃1鸡妃狗跳】她龙雪十足的现代小痞子,满嘴谎话连篇,飞来横祸的穿越,让她成了刚出生的弃婴小娃,都说大难不死必有后福,这话果真不假,不仅练得一身好武艺,耳朵还出于常人,能听懂动物的语言。出谷游玩,寻思着,开开妓院,搞搞设计,顺便再拐几个美男后宫,可,谁知的……惹上了不该惹的人,一道圣旨,便将她赐给了当今瑾王。靠,王爷了不起啊?丫的敢娶我,老娘拍死你……费尽心思,折腾到鸡飞狗跳,丫的,还是要嫁,靠,豁出去了,为了将来,她嫁……大婚当天,洞房花烛,你看我碍眼,我看你不爽嘞！啊,神啊,古代真是美男的天堂啊,是个人长得都帅,管你是什么太子王爷,她都一并全收,做好开鸭店的准备,开鸭店啊……咦?做梦都想开鸭店,可是到最后为何把自己给鸭进去了……?", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/shenyiqifei/1.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "The Miracle Doctor Abandoned His Concubine / Prerequisite Text Quotation / Kanshuge Recommended Text: [Snake King Chooses His Concubine] She is a graduate student in archeology. She was born with superpowers and electricity. She was reborn in another world and became a storm. The former number one idiot nymphomaniac in the imperial capital returned after missing, and she became her. Her principle is to keep things secret, and her hobby is to pretend to be a pig and eat a tiger. \"Someone finally wants Miss Mu family...\" someone in the crowd shouted, and the young men in the imperial capital immediately shouted long live. Marry? OK! Think of it as finding a living backer for yourself. \"My beloved, I heard that you want to electrocute me to death...\" A low and evil voice came, and warm breath sprayed on her neck. When a certain girl heard this, she clapped her hands: \"Damn, what bastard is spreading rumors? I'll slap him to death!\" \"My beloved concubine...\" A certain girl grabbed his collar with a smile: \"If you want to be my man, don't hide your head and tail.\" A certain king She was stunned for a moment, then smiled seductively, and the golden snake tail wrapped around her body: \"Okay, for you, I will reveal everything.\" In a different world, a banquet of beasts, she was a cute and powerful beast, surrounded by snakes, and became famous all over the world overnight. She is in the limelight, and all the snakes in the world are at her disposal. What's more terrible is that the man next to her is an ancestor of the snake king... [Quotes from the heroine: If you stab me in the open, I will return three knives to you; if you stab me in the dark, I will return ten knives to you; if you stab me in the open and covert, I will return a piece of honeycomb coal to you! 】The following is the conclusion of the article [Snake Doctor Princess] [Complete] She is the youngest snake doctor in China, and the direct heir to the darkest killer family in the country. She is proficient in eight languages, medical skills, ancient martial arts, tracking, strategy, psychology, and scientific research. She can do it all. During a forest inspection, a snake nest was touched, giant pythons swarmed, fog rose, and blood filled the air. When she woke up again, she saw a mass grave full of corpses. Some memories kept pouring out of her head, and the corners of her mouth twitched dryly. She traveled through time, and the seventh lady of Prime Minister Bai's Mansion returned to the Prime Minister's Mansion after resurrecting. The cowardly person no longer existed, but was extremely powerful, destroying the five ladies. With his appearance, he chopped off the eldest lady's hands and feet, threatening to break off the Sixth Prince's engagement... He, the Sixth Prince, the god of war of the Red Moon Kingdom, was cold and ruthless, and powerful in the world. He bumped into her who was equally cold, \"This engagement does not count!\" She held a long sword and resisted his throat, a cold light suddenly appeared. He chuckled softly at the corner of his mouth, and his charming voice had a hint of seduction: \"This engagement is cancelled... we fall into a new state...\" In troubled times, this is a strange magical continent with many snakes, but no one can heal people who have been bitten by poisonous snakes, but she can heal people, killing people with snakes, and saving people with snakes. With the name of Snake Doctor, he became famous all over the world. The situation is turbulent, and he flies for nine days. Let's see who can compete with the world... [Strong female, strong male, the heroine will not suffer a bit, the limelight is absolutely one-on-one] [The King's Big-name Agent Concubine] [Complete] She, the youngest genius agent in China, once traveled through time, but became the \"useless\" silly lady of the prime minister's palace. When she turned into her in the blink of an eye, she smiled with a knife. You are more cruel to me, and you are more evil to me! The storm is rising and the world is in chaos. She is born with pride and goes retrograde for nine days. This world is not just a world of men. Women can also take charge of ups and downs. She is very possessive. How big is her heart? How big is the sky? [Deadly Crazy Concubine] She is the king of killers. She takes life and death and goes her own way. She detonates a building and is reborn in another world. Faced with the annihilation of her family, blood is all over her hands. He was the stunning prince of Daxing, ruthless and ruthless, but he fell in love with her at a glance. \"Looking at the world, I will not sacrifice my life for anyone.\" The two of them said to Qi, her extremely arrogant words were as admirable as a king. In a different world, the weak eat the strong, meet gods and kill gods, meet demons and kill demons, strive for the world, be proud of the world, conquer the holy fox in the wild sands thousands of miles away, the world is full of smoke, bloody battles and killings, as arrogant as her. War in troubled times, the city is in flames, who can dominate? [Excellent cool novel, the female protagonist is extremely powerful, the male protagonist is powerful, the supporting characters are also powerful, there are many beauties, the ending is one-on-one] [Deadly Game: Sky-high Price Baby] Introduction: \"Why are you shy? Don't forget that I am the one who bought you!\" Leng Shaoyang said hoarsely as he clamped down on Zhuanteng's white and tender arms. \"Let's start!\" Because of her ugliness, she became a shame in the family, was beaten by her sister, and was cruel by her father. She was kicked out of the house, and her mother was seriously ill and she had to do this. After a long night, she raised money, but her mother had already left. Looking at her leaving mother, her heart began to grow cold, and the idea of ​​revenge gradually arose. She was no longer cowardly, and she disappeared from the world that day. Six years later, she returned for revenge. She was completely transformed. She was smart, beautiful, and the female CEO of a national company. She was shrewd in everything she did and began to plan everything. However, who would have thought that the person behind the female president is actually a five-year-old boy. ————The article is about to be completed below————[Whose Princess 1 Chicken Concubine and Dog Jumping] She is a modern little ruffian full of lies, and her time travel has made her an abandoned baby. They say that if you survive a disaster, you will be blessed later, and this is true. Not only has she practiced martial arts well, but her ears are also like ordinary people, and she can understand the language of animals. She went out to play in the valley, thinking about it, opened a brothel, made plans, and abducted a few beautiful men for the harem, but who knew... she got into trouble with someone she shouldn't have, and an imperial edict gave her to the current King Jin. Damn, the prince is amazing? Damn, you dare to marry me, I will beat you to death... After all the hard work and effort, damn, I still want to get married. Damn, I risked my life. For the sake of the future, she married... On the wedding day, there are flowers and candles in the bridal chamber. You look at me as an eyesore. I think you are unhappy! Ah, God, it was a paradise for beautiful men in ancient times. Everyone was handsome. No matter what kind of prince or prince you were, she would accept them all and be ready to open a duck shop. Open a duck shop... Eh? I dreamed of opening a duck shop, but why did I let myself in in the end...? Recommended text: [Snake King Selects His Concubine] She is a graduate student in archeology.", "title_en": "Chapter 1"}